BIYO contributes to a global improvement of sustainable energy, potable water and food production.

BIYO helps clients to secure an affordable, reliable, and sustainable energy and water supply needed to help make an end to extreme poverty and promote shared prosperity. Through the development of renewable energy sources in combination with potable water supplies we contribute to create a more sustainable world.

Our main focus is on assisting governments, NGO’s and private enterprises to produce enough green energy and potable water in a sustainable and equitable manner.

In our vision reuse of degenerated agricultural areas is a main pre-requisite to reach that goal.

Activities:
- Development of Renewable Energy Solutions;
- Development of Potable Water Solutions;
- Investment and Financing;
- Engineering (EPC);
- Project Implementation;
- Operations and Maintenance.
